{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/EngSwordDanceGif.gif?t=1749676141\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Cultivation Story: Infinite Sword Realm, a Cultivation Themed roguelike deckbuilder where every decision impacts your journey. Build a powerful deck from a variety of unique cards, collect relics, and unlock special perks that can shift the odds in your favor. Explore special levels filled with challenging enemies, random encounters, and valuable treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/LevelupEngGif.gif?t=1749676141\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run brings fresh challenges, with endless replayability through evolving strategies, powerful relic and upgrade combinations. Engage in turn-based combat that requires careful planning and resource management as you adapt to an ever-changing world of danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/extras/CardListEngGif.gif?t=1749676141\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3159440?t=1749676141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749676141","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/f97c5426ef678a24a62cb4f38ffffb9a89fc18b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749676141","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3159440/f97c5426ef678a24a62cb4f38ffffb9a89fc18b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749676141","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Fa